WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

3
03:09.563 --> 03:14.651
Someone invited me to this cafe business conference next week.

4
03:14.651 --> 03:16.862
If you want, I'll just give you the invite.

5
03:17.071 --> 03:19.782
It's at Claremont Hotel.

6
03:19.782 --> 03:21.784
Sure, please. Send me the details.

7
03:21.784 --> 03:23.827
There's nothing special in what I did.

8
03:24.495 --> 03:25.621
It's just bare minimum.

9
03:25.621 --> 03:27.998
I have no time to spare on someone like you.

10
03:27.998 --> 03:29.833
Same old you.

11
03:30.584 --> 03:32.127
Non-believer of love.

12
03:32.586 --> 03:33.962
Lopez!

13
03:34.713 --> 03:36.757
I hate you! You jerk!

14
03:38.550 --> 03:39.802
You deserved it.

15
03:40.636 --> 03:43.097
Why do you look like that? You look sick.

16
03:43.722 --> 03:44.598
No, I'm fine.

17
03:44.598 --> 03:45.891
Stop crying!

18
03:45.891 --> 03:47.559
I said, stop. You won't stop, huh?

19
03:47.559 --> 03:48.769
You won't stop?

20
03:48.852 --> 03:50.354
Enough!

21
03:51.605 --> 03:52.231
Kierra?

22
03:52.231 --> 03:53.273
You’re safe here.

23
03:53.273 --> 03:54.608
Kierra, you’re safe here

24
03:54.900 --> 03:55.567
Okay?

25
03:55.651 --> 03:56.443
All right.

26
03:56.819 --> 03:58.487
I’ll take you out on a date.

27
03:59.321 --> 04:01.281
Let me make you a special drink,

28
04:02.199 --> 04:03.450
to switch things up.

29
04:05.327 --> 04:07.788
Fine. surprise me.

30
04:16.964 --> 04:18.048
You really like it, huh?

31
04:19.299 --> 04:22.261
Well, you won't find that anywhere else.

32
04:23.345 --> 04:25.556
That's why you have no choice but to come back here.

33
04:26.890 --> 04:28.100
You fell into my trap.

34
04:30.477 --> 04:31.270
Whatever.

35
05:10.308 --> 05:11.309
See you yesterday.

36
05:12.841 --> 05:14.676
Yesterday’s already in the past.

37
05:14.771 --> 05:15.898
You should say, “See you soon”.

38
05:17.483 --> 05:20.986
By tomorrow, today will just be another yesterday—

39
05:21.278 --> 05:23.739
and tomorrow will be another yesterday, the next day.

40
05:24.239 --> 05:27.034
The past is certain, the future is not.

41
05:28.202 --> 05:29.578
So, I'll see you certainly.

42
05:31.955 --> 05:33.248
That's what it means.

43
05:35.709 --> 05:36.877
See you yesterday.

44
05:37.544 --> 05:38.712
See you yesterday.

45
05:45.594 --> 05:46.970
Excuse me.

46
05:47.304 --> 05:48.472
Can I order now?

47
05:48.472 --> 05:50.849
Oh sure. Sorry for the wait, ma'am.

48
05:54.937 --> 05:56.313
Sorry ma'am, what's your order?

49
05:56.313 --> 05:57.898
- Okay, I'm having— - Yeah…

50
05:57.898 --> 05:59.191
a caramel macchiato.

51
05:59.191 --> 05:59.983
Okay.

52
06:02.945 --> 06:04.446
Also, one cheesecake.

53
06:08.534 --> 06:09.535
So your order is—

54
06:09.535 --> 06:11.203
- one caramel macchiato, iced. - Yes.

55
06:11.203 --> 06:12.829
- And one cheesecake. - And then—

56
06:18.043 --> 06:19.169
It's so hot!

57
06:19.878 --> 06:20.587
Hey, Ke!

58
06:21.463 --> 06:24.591
Hey, Theo! You're a lifesaver.

59
06:25.052 --> 06:26.595
It’s really hot today.

60
06:26.620 --> 06:28.122
Why are you just covering me?

61
06:28.147 --> 06:30.315
- Cover yourself, too. - No, it's fine. I'm okay.

62
06:30.764 --> 06:33.225
Really? You're sweating. You might get sick.

63
06:33.225 --> 06:36.311
Geez. You worry too much about me.

64
06:36.979 --> 06:38.480
I might end up falling for you.

65
06:38.939 --> 06:40.899
You're crazy. Let's go.

66
06:42.822 --> 06:43.990
Almost there.

67
06:44.695 --> 06:46.241
I'm almost going crazy for you.

68
08:23.043 --> 08:24.169
Can I help?

69
08:27.589 --> 08:28.507
Let me see.

70
08:39.559 --> 08:40.477
There you go.

71
08:41.186 --> 08:43.438
It's a little better now.

72
08:43.772 --> 08:49.403
But we can fix it better when we get home.

73
08:49.403 --> 08:50.278
Thank you.

74
08:54.908 --> 08:55.784
Shan.

75
08:56.618 --> 09:01.415
Your mom told me you want to go to high school in Manila?

76
09:03.417 --> 09:05.585
Yes, but Mom doesn't want me to do it.

77
09:05.961 --> 09:09.214
She says it's better here. Far away from Dad.

78
09:12.467 --> 09:14.553
But do you really want to study in Manila?

79
09:21.852 --> 09:23.854
Okay, fine.

80
09:24.187 --> 09:26.189
I'll talk to your mom about this.

81
09:26.606 --> 09:27.941
You'll do that for me?

82
09:28.525 --> 09:29.276
Wait…

83
09:30.444 --> 09:31.945
In exchange for what?

84
09:33.655 --> 09:34.448
Nothing.

85
09:35.240 --> 09:38.243
I just want you to live the life you want.

86
09:39.453 --> 09:40.746
You're like a son to me.

87
09:41.371 --> 09:42.706
You don't mean that.

88
09:45.250 --> 09:48.336
I know you're finding it hard

89
09:48.336 --> 09:50.630
to accept me as part of your life.

90
09:51.757 --> 09:57.345
But I'll keep trying until you accept me.

91
09:59.514 --> 10:01.558
I know what you've been through, Shan.

92
10:02.684 --> 10:06.688
And I think you've been very brave through it all.

93
10:07.397 --> 10:12.569
Your mom is just worried about you because you'll be alone in Manila.

94
10:12.944 --> 10:17.491
But if that's what you really want, we'll find a way.

95
10:17.991 --> 10:18.700
Okay?

96
10:19.701 --> 10:21.828
Okay. Thank you, Uncle.

97
10:24.122 --> 10:25.999
I promise to protect you and your mom.

98
10:27.501 --> 10:28.752
Do you know why?

99
10:29.920 --> 10:31.546
Because I love you both.

100
10:33.423 --> 10:37.761
If you have anything else to say, I'm here. Okay?

101
10:38.845 --> 10:43.016
And if you want, we can go to other beaches around here.

102
10:44.476 --> 10:46.353
Thank you, Uncle.

103
10:49.064 --> 10:50.857
You’re a good kid, Shan.

104
10:52.639 --> 10:53.685
A good kid, huh?

105
10:54.615 --> 10:56.335
They used to tell me that all the time.

106
10:56.859 --> 11:00.154
But... Am I still a good kid now?

107
11:01.084 --> 11:02.084
I don't know.

108
11:06.055 --> 11:07.348
Yeah, I’ll follow.

109
11:15.928 --> 11:16.929
Shan.

110
11:16.929 --> 11:17.554
Bro.

111
11:17.554 --> 11:18.514
Bro.

112
11:18.514 --> 11:19.807
'Sup, homie.

113
11:20.474 --> 11:21.266
How are you?

114
11:23.227 --> 11:24.102
So…

115
11:24.728 --> 11:25.604
You thought about it?

116
11:26.355 --> 11:28.816
You really don't want to join?

117
11:29.650 --> 11:31.151
- Frat? - Mhmm.

118
11:31.360 --> 11:32.110
No.

119
11:32.486 --> 11:33.362
Come on.

120
11:33.779 --> 11:34.947
Bro, just think about it.

121
11:34.947 --> 11:36.657
Just stop, stop. Stop.

122
11:36.657 --> 11:38.951
Being a member of a fraternity has many advantages.

123
11:39.201 --> 11:43.997
Most of our teachers are alumni of the same fraternity. Remember?

124
11:44.164 --> 11:46.458
You never know when you might need the right connections, and...

125
11:46.458 --> 11:47.167
think about it.

126
11:47.876 --> 11:50.128
After the bar, you'll get a job.

127
11:50.462 --> 11:52.256
It's very different when you have someone backing you up.

128
11:54.925 --> 11:57.845
So, nepotism? Corruption?

129
11:58.637 --> 12:01.640
Funny, isn't it? It's no big deal to you.

130
12:02.099 --> 12:03.308
Oh, Shan…

131
12:03.308 --> 12:06.311
I didn't create the system. It's already there.

132
12:06.311 --> 12:07.771
Bro, it has been around for a long time.

133
12:07.771 --> 12:09.690
I'm just here for the long game.

134
12:12.693 --> 12:15.237
Haze, do you know anyone named Miguel?

135
12:16.321 --> 12:17.072
Which one?

136
12:17.990 --> 12:22.160
Delos Santos, Madahan, Reyes, Lumpas…

137
12:22.160 --> 12:23.620
There are many Miguels in my circle.

138
12:24.496 --> 12:25.539
Villaflor.

139
12:27.374 --> 12:29.501
Why? Is he still out there?

140
12:30.711 --> 12:31.461
What do you mean?

141
12:32.546 --> 12:33.839
Is he supposed to be in jail?

142
12:34.172 --> 12:35.215
Shouldn’t he be?

143
12:35.299 --> 12:37.718
He has a history of drugging people at parties.

144
12:38.135 --> 12:41.388
Someone also filed a lawsuit, but it was dismissed for some reason.

145
12:42.306 --> 12:45.642
For "some reason"— referring to his father.

146
12:46.226 --> 12:49.062
Wait, wait. Villaflor, right?

147
12:49.189 --> 12:51.442
So this is the mayor's son?

148
12:52.107 --> 12:53.010
Yes.

149
12:53.150 --> 12:56.653
His grandfather is a senator, and his uncles are in the government.

150
12:57.070 --> 12:57.846
Fuck.

151
12:58.405 --> 13:00.532
They have turned the government into a business.

152
13:00.991 --> 13:01.955
Right?

153
13:02.034 --> 13:04.578
They will not allow their name to be tarnished.

154
13:05.078 --> 13:06.163
That is why they will do everything possible

155
13:06.163 --> 13:08.040
to cover up Miguel's shit.

156
13:09.541 --> 13:11.418
He is violent and also has a huge ego.

157
13:11.919 --> 13:13.921
He thinks he is superior to everyone else.

158
13:16.590 --> 13:17.549
Come on, Shan.

159
13:17.883 --> 13:20.719
I know you want to. Just give it a chance.

160
13:20.969 --> 13:21.887
You won't regret it.

161
13:21.887 --> 13:23.513
You never take "no" for an answer, do you?

162
13:24.056 --> 13:24.863
Can you?

163
13:30.771 --> 13:32.773
Okay. Sure.

164
13:32.952 --> 13:33.744
You’re right.

165
13:34.168 --> 13:36.318
I'll give you some space so you don't get mad at me.

166
13:36.568 --> 13:37.110
But—

167
13:37.694 --> 13:39.154
Shan, bro.

168
13:40.053 --> 13:43.265
I’m telling you this is an opportunity, and you know why?

169
13:46.119 --> 13:47.496
You fit in with us.

170
14:01.051 --> 14:03.011
Shan, I miss you!

171
14:03.428 --> 14:05.097
When can I see you?

172
14:05.389 --> 14:07.057
Don't forget the books, okay?

173
14:11.100 --> 14:12.394
Here you go.

174
14:12.419 --> 14:13.712
And something for you, too.

175
14:13.821 --> 14:14.822
Thanks, Shan.

176
14:14.940 --> 14:18.110
But next time, let's just meet at the cafe, okay?

177
14:18.388 --> 14:19.932
I'll let Roel know, too.

178
14:20.570 --> 14:23.156
Relax. I heard Dad isn't even home.

179
14:23.156 --> 14:24.866
I heard he's going to Osaka.

180
14:26.535 --> 14:28.787
You know, if you weren't here in this house,

181
14:29.788 --> 14:30.872
I wouldn't keep coming.

182
14:30.872 --> 14:32.124
I won't come here often.

183
14:32.879 --> 14:34.042
What’s that for anyway?

184
14:35.043 --> 14:35.711
Shan.

185
14:39.631 --> 14:41.049
Elyse, go to your room.

186
14:59.192 --> 14:59.985
Fuck you.

187
14:59.985 --> 15:01.987
Were you hiding your mother's money from me?

188
15:02.461 --> 15:03.332
Huh?

189
15:03.613 --> 15:04.614
Why?

190
15:05.365 --> 15:06.867
You wanna take that too?

191
15:07.075 --> 15:07.743
Huh?

192
15:09.244 --> 15:11.747
How dare you talk back to me? Damn you!

193
15:13.915 --> 15:14.916
What?

194
15:15.751 --> 15:17.377
Do you want her money too?

195
15:17.502 --> 15:18.170
Huh?

196
15:18.170 --> 15:20.297
Are you angry because she didn't leave you anything?

197
15:20.547 --> 15:25.343
After everything you left her with— all the problems, the trauma, the pain, the wounds.

198
15:25.552 --> 15:27.095
And what? A secret family?

199
15:27.095 --> 15:28.096
Fuck you.

200
15:28.330 --> 15:30.207
Don't even think about involving Elyse in this.

201
15:32.559 --> 15:34.352
Don't get me fucking wrong.

202
15:35.562 --> 15:37.272
Elyse has nothing to do with this.

203
15:37.626 --> 15:38.877
This is all you.

204
15:40.233 --> 15:41.651
This is all you!

205
15:42.027 --> 15:42.861
What's this?

206
15:44.196 --> 15:44.988
What is this?

207
15:46.031 --> 15:47.866
Do you want to take revenge on me?

208
15:48.424 --> 15:49.926
Well? Go ahead!

209
15:49.951 --> 15:52.162
Tighter. Do you want to kill me?

210
15:53.080 --> 15:53.894
Can you?

211
15:54.122 --> 15:54.915
Go ahead.

212
15:54.946 --> 15:55.932
Why?

213
15:55.957 --> 15:57.584
Do you want to die?

214
15:57.793 --> 16:00.879
Doesn't it seem too easy to you, Dad?

215
16:01.963 --> 16:02.756
Huh?

216
16:06.304 --> 16:08.598
Go ahead. Can you do it?

217
16:10.097 --> 16:11.098
Go.

218
16:14.684 --> 16:15.644
Kill me.

219
16:18.772 --> 16:21.024
So I could be just like your mom.

220
16:22.499 --> 16:24.626
Your mom who's dead already.

221
16:32.702 --> 16:33.995
Fuck you.

222
16:38.075 --> 16:40.911
You're just like me.

223
16:51.510 --> 16:53.846
Ciandrei! That's enough.

224
17:04.526 --> 17:06.278
Sir, let's go.

225
17:17.038 --> 17:19.249
I was afraid of monsters growing up.

226
17:21.209 --> 17:23.420
I tried to be brave to fight against them.

227
17:32.637 --> 17:34.472
But sometimes I wonder,

228
17:36.016 --> 17:37.267
What if…

229
17:39.769 --> 17:42.189
What if there's a little monster inside of me, too?

230
17:43.273 --> 17:44.566
I’m not like him.

231
17:47.652 --> 17:49.112
I’m not like him.

232
17:55.994 --> 17:57.746
I don't want to be like them.

233
18:21.394 --> 18:23.438
Thank you. We’ll have your drinks ready in a bit.

234
18:32.030 --> 18:32.989
What's that?

235
18:34.259 --> 18:37.346
Interior design for a coffee shop. Isn’t it obvious?

236
18:44.597 --> 18:46.765
No outside drinks allowed here.

237
18:47.003 --> 18:50.715
But I'm not drinking it. Just let me be, Ciandrei.

238
18:52.946 --> 18:55.866
Just call me Shan. We're friends already, right?

239
18:57.013 --> 18:58.598
I don't want us to be friends.

240
18:59.828 --> 19:01.121
More than friends?

241
19:01.685 --> 19:02.684
Less.

242
19:04.396 --> 19:07.691
More than friends, less than lovers.

243
19:08.525 --> 19:10.860
All right, that sounds good to me.

244
19:17.215 --> 19:20.954
Ugh. No outside food allowed.

245
19:20.954 --> 19:24.124
You notice everything. Do you have a problem?

246
19:24.945 --> 19:25.862
With you?

247
19:26.876 --> 19:27.836
No.

248
19:27.836 --> 19:29.212
No, with something else.

249
19:29.212 --> 19:31.589
Because it looks like you're just distracting yourself.

250
19:37.137 --> 19:38.054
What is that?

251
19:38.805 --> 19:39.848
Is it because of that?

252
19:40.637 --> 19:41.221
No.

253
19:41.246 --> 19:42.044
No, no.

254
19:42.517 --> 19:43.435
Just had a fight.

255
19:44.019 --> 19:44.936
It's nothing serious.

256
19:45.395 --> 19:46.813
Did a girl hit you?

257
19:49.107 --> 19:50.025
No.

258
19:56.418 --> 19:57.878
Hey, are you okay?

259
19:59.159 --> 20:00.827
Yeah. Yeah, I'm fine.

260
20:01.234 --> 20:03.110
Do you want my special Sakura drink?

261
20:05.457 --> 20:06.416
Okay.

262
20:07.042 --> 20:07.917
One order.

263
20:08.293 --> 20:11.421
All right. One Sakura drink for Kierra, coming right up.

264
20:25.310 --> 20:26.978
You want to get revenge on me?

265
20:28.313 --> 20:29.981
Go ahead. Tighter.

266
20:30.440 --> 20:31.524
You want to kill me?

267
20:36.446 --> 20:37.364
Can you?

268
20:37.864 --> 20:38.573
Go ahead.

269
20:38.573 --> 20:39.115
Why?

270
20:39.115 --> 20:40.950
Do you want to die?

271
20:41.076 --> 20:42.744
Isn't that too easy for you?

272
20:46.122 --> 20:46.790
Go ahead.

273
20:47.374 --> 20:48.333
Can you do it?

274
20:48.833 --> 20:49.626
Kill me.

275
20:49.626 --> 20:53.046
Kill me.

276
21:00.970 --> 21:03.473
You’re just like me.

277
21:04.307 --> 21:05.975
Sir, are you all right?

278
21:10.313 --> 21:12.148
Yeah, I just spilled a bit.

279
21:13.384 --> 21:15.135
Okay, I’ll take care of it later.

280
21:15.774 --> 21:17.860
Sure. Thanks, Alex. Thank you.

281
21:53.940 --> 21:55.191
Here’s your drink.

282
21:58.945 --> 22:02.323
Are you doing anything later?

283
22:03.241 --> 22:06.661
I just have something I need to finish. The deadline is tomorrow.

284
22:08.788 --> 22:09.914
After that,

285
22:10.957 --> 22:12.292
do you want another escape?

286
22:16.421 --> 22:17.589
Where are we going?

287
22:20.049 --> 22:23.261
Where I go when I want to be alone.

288
22:26.222 --> 22:27.098
All right then.

289
22:30.292 --> 22:31.060
Okay.

290
22:38.693 --> 22:39.944
Where's your car?

291
22:41.905 --> 22:42.739
Here.

292
22:44.409 --> 22:48.161
I haven't used it in a while. It was stored in my condo.

293
22:48.745 --> 22:51.873
Do you no longer use it? Is it still safe?

294
22:52.499 --> 22:53.666
Yeah, for sure.

295
22:54.042 --> 22:55.627
I get it checked regularly.

296
23:00.465 --> 23:01.299
You haven't used it in a while,

297
23:01.299 --> 23:04.093
but you always keep an extra helmet ready for a girl?

298
23:04.328 --> 23:06.538
I haven't given any girl a ride on this yet.

299
23:06.888 --> 23:08.264
You can't fool me.

300
23:08.901 --> 23:09.849
It’s the truth.

301
23:14.604 --> 23:15.897
Uh, sorry.

302
23:16.856 --> 23:19.984
Is riding a motorcycle okay with you? If not, I’ll get the car.

303
23:19.984 --> 23:22.403
That's fine. But will my things fit?

304
23:22.654 --> 23:23.589
Just put it here.

305
23:24.093 --> 23:24.844
You sure it’s okay?

306
23:33.540 --> 23:34.495
Let me help you.

307
23:43.967 --> 23:44.839
Is it tight?

308
23:45.987 --> 23:46.988
How's that? Is it okay?

309
23:49.931 --> 23:50.974
How do I look?

310
23:52.517 --> 23:53.726
Like a pro.

311
24:16.457 --> 24:17.750
It's beautiful here, right?

312
24:19.121 --> 24:21.123
It's actually my first time bringing someone here.

313
24:22.130 --> 24:23.506
You can't fool me.

314
24:26.301 --> 24:27.218
I’m telling the truth.

315
24:29.846 --> 24:35.268
By the way, I have a question for you, but don't think I'm interested in you, okay?

316
24:35.429 --> 24:36.681
Because I'm not.

317
24:38.279 --> 24:39.864
Have you ever had a girlfriend?

318
24:43.067 --> 24:44.527
I've dated around,

319
24:46.112 --> 24:47.572
but I haven't had a girlfriend yet.

320
24:48.740 --> 24:50.366
Don't even ask how many.

321
24:51.451 --> 24:52.619
So you're a cheater?

322
24:54.287 --> 24:55.121
Nah.

323
24:55.580 --> 24:57.290
I don't juggle multiple girls at the same time.

324
24:58.330 --> 24:59.164
They just…

325
25:00.084 --> 25:01.210
They just don't last long.

326
25:01.961 --> 25:02.795
How come?

327
25:06.257 --> 25:09.510
I don't see the point, so I don't bother getting to know them anymore.

328
25:09.808 --> 25:12.519
I'm sticking to my "only fucking” rule.

329
25:14.265 --> 25:15.558
Did you love them?

330
25:19.854 --> 25:26.444
Because if not, then you're just extending your pain to them.

331
25:28.112 --> 25:33.868
The truth is, I tell them right from the start that I don’t commit.

332
25:35.244 --> 25:38.623
We date, we fuck, and then we get tired of each other.

333
25:39.624 --> 25:42.377
My question is, did you love them?

334
25:45.797 --> 25:47.298
I don't know how to love.

335
25:50.593 --> 25:53.221
Excuse me, here are your orders.

336
25:53.429 --> 25:54.555
- Thank you. - Thank you.

337
25:54.555 --> 25:55.339
Thanks.

338
25:59.866 --> 26:02.827
So you've never tried courting anyone?

339
26:04.857 --> 26:05.692
No.

340
26:06.984 --> 26:11.489
Because when you court someone, that means you want to commit, right?

341
26:11.827 --> 26:13.537
And you never really plan to commit?

342
26:16.411 --> 26:18.003
I thought it was just one question?

343
26:18.121 --> 26:23.793
But it seems like that's number 765 for today.

344
26:24.919 --> 26:25.878
So dramatic.

345
26:27.296 --> 26:28.423
I get the feeling...

346
26:30.633 --> 26:32.844
That you might be really interested in me.

347
26:34.191 --> 26:35.221
You want to date me, right?

348
26:36.073 --> 26:37.432
I'm not that stupid.

349
26:37.849 --> 26:40.017
Your mere presence bothers me.

350
26:40.685 --> 26:41.561
Really?

351
26:43.020 --> 26:44.564
I don’t think you're annoyed right now.

352
26:45.440 --> 26:47.275
It seems like you're enjoying my company.

353
26:49.026 --> 26:51.446
You're the least person I’d want to be with.

354
26:52.155 --> 26:56.159
But again, who's with you right now?

355
26:56.909 --> 26:58.911
Whatever. You have an answer for everything.

356
27:00.079 --> 27:01.664
‘Cause you ask so many questions.

357
27:22.935 --> 27:25.313
Where were you last night? You got home late.

358
27:25.897 --> 27:28.370
I finished my project at that coffee shop.

359
27:28.553 --> 27:30.534
It's a good thing there's one that's open 24 hours, right?

360
27:33.070 --> 27:34.238
Is that Ma'am Dayrit’s class?

361
27:34.822 --> 27:37.992
She’s scary. Thank goodness she isn't my professor

362
27:39.410 --> 27:41.078
Our deadline is today.

363
27:42.955 --> 27:43.873
Deadline.

364
27:46.167 --> 27:47.043
Shit!

365
27:47.043 --> 27:47.960
Shit!

366
27:47.960 --> 27:48.461
What?

367
27:48.461 --> 27:49.921
- What happened? - My project!

368
27:50.296 --> 27:51.172
What?

369
28:04.227 --> 28:05.645
Where’s Ciandrei?

370
28:06.437 --> 28:07.438
He has the day off.

371
28:07.529 --> 28:10.073
Huh? Can I get his number?

372
28:11.859 --> 28:13.945
I deleted it from my phone.

373
28:14.237 --> 28:16.113
He's my friend. I'm his friend.

374
28:16.447 --> 28:17.532
Sure.

375
28:22.620 --> 28:23.704
Thanks.

376
28:24.753 --> 28:26.332
Please answer.

377
28:27.708 --> 28:29.085
I'm gonna be late because of this.

378
28:30.294 --> 28:31.128
Excuse me.

379
28:31.128 --> 28:34.257
I'm so sorry. It's just that it's very important. Could you give me his address?

380
28:34.465 --> 28:35.842
He's not answering.

381
28:35.842 --> 28:36.801
Address?

382
28:48.354 --> 28:49.355
906.

383
28:53.526 --> 28:55.444
This should be the right place, right?

384
28:56.571 --> 28:57.572
906.

385
29:13.796 --> 29:15.798
What? You want more?

386
29:21.053 --> 29:21.846
I’m sorry.

387
29:21.846 --> 29:22.638
Uhmm—

388
29:22.889 --> 29:26.100
I left my project on your motorcycle.

389
29:26.767 --> 29:28.853
Yeah, I already brought it inside.

390
29:29.520 --> 29:29.979
Come in.

391
29:29.979 --> 29:30.813
No!

392
29:32.273 --> 29:33.649
No need, maybe—

393
29:34.233 --> 29:35.192
Shan?

394
29:35.860 --> 29:37.570
I knew it! You fucker!

395
29:38.750 --> 29:41.498
Is this why you’re not answering my calls?

396
29:42.074 --> 29:44.702
Why? Do I not satisfy you?

397
29:45.286 --> 29:45.995
Oh my god.

398
29:47.538 --> 29:50.333
Okay. Just walk. Just go inside, we’ll talk inside.

399
29:50.666 --> 29:53.836
We’re just gonna talk? I mean, we can do other things.

400
29:55.671 --> 29:57.131
Didn’t you come here for that?

401
29:57.673 --> 29:59.884
Okay, so either you leave or you go inside.

402
30:07.642 --> 30:08.976
Here. I’m sorry.

403
30:09.936 --> 30:10.796
It’s okay.

404
30:11.020 --> 30:12.480
Don't worry, I'm not judging you.

405
30:13.814 --> 30:15.983
Don't worry, I'll get rid of her too.

406
30:15.983 --> 30:17.360
Don't worry, I don't care.

407
30:18.361 --> 30:20.112
Next time, don't leave your stuff.

408
30:20.488 --> 30:22.657
Why? Because your girls might see?

409
30:23.975 --> 30:25.393
I thought you didn't care?

410
30:26.160 --> 30:27.085
You actually do, huh?

411
30:27.453 --> 30:28.329
I do.

412
30:28.746 --> 30:30.539
For the girls. Duh!

413
30:31.743 --> 30:34.370
Wait, I'll walk you to the lobby.

414
30:34.395 --> 30:35.939
It’s fine. Someone's waiting for you.

415
30:37.155 --> 30:37.906
Yes.

416
30:38.605 --> 30:39.940
So you really don't care, huh?

417
30:41.717 --> 30:42.677
See you never.

418
30:46.472 --> 30:48.057
See you yesterday, Zylene.

419
31:09.578 --> 31:11.497
Did you set me up without my knowledge?

420
31:12.081 --> 31:13.582
No. Do you want me to?

421
31:14.458 --> 31:15.876
I mean, I can make it happen.

422
31:15.876 --> 31:18.462
I'm just asking if you set me up.

423
31:19.171 --> 31:22.383
You know, Theo could work.

424
31:22.967 --> 31:24.010
Yeah.

425
31:24.010 --> 31:26.262
He's smart, handsome, kind…

426
31:27.471 --> 31:28.698
And it seems like he has a crush on you.

427
31:28.723 --> 31:29.765
He doesn't have a crush on me.

428
31:30.016 --> 31:31.308
I bet he does.

429
31:31.333 --> 31:33.418
You don't like that? You'd be a power couple.

430
31:33.443 --> 31:36.237
Engineer, Architect. Cute.

431
31:36.262 --> 31:37.347
We don't match.

432
31:38.983 --> 31:42.361
Then let's look through Sam's followers, there's a lot of hot guys here.

433
31:42.987 --> 31:44.697
Pick one, from here.

434
31:45.906 --> 31:47.299
What is this? A menu?

435
31:47.433 --> 31:48.434
Go.

436
31:54.415 --> 31:55.791
He follows me?

437
31:57.334 --> 31:58.669
So, interested in anyone?

438
31:58.669 --> 31:59.378
No.

439
32:00.337 --> 32:02.068
I'm just asking if you'll introduce me to someone,

440
32:02.092 --> 32:03.716
but I have no plans to get a boyfriend again.

441
32:03.716 --> 32:04.508
Ah.

442
32:04.925 --> 32:06.844
Well, in any case, when there is one, you have to tell me.

443
32:07.091 --> 32:08.217
I need to meet him.

444
32:19.315 --> 32:20.274
Hey.

445
32:20.483 --> 32:21.400
Let’s go have a drink.

446
32:22.318 --> 32:24.779
Do I look free? I have a lot of things to finish.

447
32:24.779 --> 32:27.615
- Just go with Via. - Ke, come on.

448
32:27.615 --> 32:31.827
Come drink with me. Via said she’s busy.

449
32:33.412 --> 32:34.580
Really?

450
32:34.605 --> 32:36.899
Okay, agreed, then I'll go home with you. Let's go together.

451
32:36.924 --> 32:38.551
But I’ll be going to the coffee shop.

452
32:40.753 --> 32:42.463
Fine… Okay, be careful.

453
32:43.506 --> 32:44.632
- Bye. - Bye!

454
32:50.638 --> 32:51.972
- Oh, Theo! - Hey.

455
32:52.181 --> 32:53.057
- Thanks. - Geez.

456
32:53.057 --> 32:54.600
Give it to me. I’ll carry it.

457
32:55.101 --> 32:57.228
Thank you. Don't you have class?

458
32:58.062 --> 33:00.758
All set. I was hanging out with Master.

459
33:01.857 --> 33:04.443
Do you want me to take you home? You're carrying a lot of things.

460
33:04.443 --> 33:07.696
No, I still have to stop by a coffee shop. I have a lot left to finish.

461
33:09.198 --> 33:10.950
You know Yesterday's Coffee?

462
33:11.325 --> 33:13.953
Yeah, I've heard of it.

463
33:14.286 --> 33:15.955
My friends told me about it because, apparently,

464
33:15.955 --> 33:18.916
there's a very handsome barista there whom everyone likes.

465
33:20.376 --> 33:21.460
Can you believe that?

466
33:25.172 --> 33:27.842
Actually, can I come with you?

467
33:28.425 --> 33:30.761
I have some homework I need to do, too.

468
33:31.178 --> 33:32.096
Sure, come on.

469
33:32.096 --> 33:32.789
Let's go.

470
33:35.224 --> 33:37.101
Love is fucking crazy, Ely.

471
33:37.101 --> 33:38.727
And it’s not even for me.

472
33:39.937 --> 33:41.897
You know what? It's amazing to be in love.

473
33:42.314 --> 33:43.607
I can’t wait to be in love.

474
33:44.339 --> 33:46.133
It's not that important in life.

475
33:48.096 --> 33:51.933
You know, you should at least have one person that you cherish and love.

476
33:52.992 --> 33:56.012
The kind of love that makes you want to grow

477
33:56.036 --> 33:58.914
and makes you accept each other's flaws.

478
33:58.914 --> 34:00.082
Don’t you want that?

479
34:02.126 --> 34:02.960
I don't.

480
34:05.754 --> 34:08.424
Yeah. You’re gonna be single for the rest of your life, Shan.

481
34:08.424 --> 34:09.758
And successful.

482
34:10.426 --> 34:12.133
And I don’t think there’s anything wrong with that.

483
34:12.158 --> 34:12.700
Right?

484
34:13.095 --> 34:13.637
Yup.

485
34:13.637 --> 34:15.014
Of course. Yes.

486
34:15.181 --> 34:16.390
You do you, Shan.

487
34:17.099 --> 34:18.309
Okay, I’m gonna go.

488
34:18.893 --> 34:19.685
Okay, take care.

489
34:19.685 --> 34:20.811
Thank you.

490
34:21.020 --> 34:21.562
Bye-bye.

491
34:23.767 --> 34:24.867
You take care, Ely.

492
34:32.907 --> 34:34.617
It seems like a nice place to do homework.

493
34:34.825 --> 34:37.119
Right? So, find a seat already.

494
34:37.119 --> 34:37.494
Okay.

495
34:38.419 --> 34:39.295
Give me your things first.

496
34:40.262 --> 34:41.203
Can you manage?

497
34:47.838 --> 34:49.215
Long time no see.

498
34:49.965 --> 34:50.799
You have a date?

499
34:52.509 --> 34:54.261
Can I order one

500
34:54.261 --> 34:56.013
"mind your own business," please?

501
34:56.805 --> 34:58.724
What else? A hot "leave me alone"?

502
35:01.518 --> 35:05.606
One matcha latte and one iced Americano.

503
35:06.649 --> 35:08.567
What about our special Sakura drink?

504
35:09.109 --> 35:09.944
No, thanks.

505
35:14.281 --> 35:15.324
Name for the drinks?

506
35:16.367 --> 35:17.368
Kierra…

507
35:18.619 --> 35:20.079
and Theo.

508
35:21.247 --> 35:22.039
Okay.

509
35:24.124 --> 35:26.961
That would be 360 pesos.

510
35:30.422 --> 35:31.423
Thank you.

511
35:33.008 --> 35:33.676
Okay.

512
35:34.051 --> 35:36.149
I'll just call your names when your drinks are ready, okay?

513
35:52.512 --> 35:55.453
Why did I even choose this? Architecture is so hard.

514
35:57.908 --> 35:59.326
Do you still get to sleep?

515
35:59.994 --> 36:00.911
Of course.

516
36:01.036 --> 36:02.579
What about you? How's engineering?

517
36:03.080 --> 36:04.290
You still don't have a girlfriend?

518
36:06.648 --> 36:12.029
Actually, since taking up Engineering, things haven't really gone great.

519
36:16.093 --> 36:16.927
Hey.

520
36:18.595 --> 36:19.430
Hey.

521
36:19.513 --> 36:20.055
What?

522
36:20.080 --> 36:21.456
I'm serious.

523
36:22.391 --> 36:24.143
I actually envy you.

524
36:24.549 --> 36:26.760
Master told me you're really smart.

525
36:26.916 --> 36:29.335
That's why I know you can handle architecture.

526
36:31.066 --> 36:32.776
It's just exhausting.

527
36:34.028 --> 36:35.320
It is exhausting.

528
36:37.072 --> 36:39.033
But you'll keep fighting, right?

529
36:43.454 --> 36:45.835
Order for Kierra and Theo.

530
36:52.516 --> 36:53.377
Enjoy.

531
36:54.048 --> 36:54.937
Thank you.

532
37:00.763 --> 37:01.597
Hey.

533
37:04.725 --> 37:07.436
That barista is good-looking.

534
37:07.968 --> 37:10.971
He's probably the handsome one my friends were talking about.

535
37:12.149 --> 37:14.193
Huh, is he handsome?

536
37:15.569 --> 37:16.820
Are you blind?

537
37:18.572 --> 37:20.866
I mean, admit it, he does have the looks.

538
38:37.568 --> 38:38.986
Nice feed.

539
38:39.820 --> 38:41.405
This is very her.

540
38:42.448 --> 38:44.116
Should I follow you back?

541
39:02.468 --> 39:03.687
Elyse?

542
39:05.132 --> 39:06.299
Yanna.

543
39:24.486 --> 39:26.071
Right? You guys are happy?

544
39:26.096 --> 39:28.056
So happy. How happy?

545
39:28.081 --> 39:31.126
- Cheers! - Cheers!

546
39:35.461 --> 39:38.648
Hey, take it easy there.

547
39:38.907 --> 39:40.534
Just let me be. I'm happy.

548
39:40.559 --> 39:42.269
How happy?

549
39:42.611 --> 39:44.749
- How much? - So happy because—

550
39:45.093 --> 39:47.012
- Because? - Because I can go out now.

551
39:47.012 --> 39:47.971
Okay.

552
39:47.971 --> 39:51.350
I'm still scared, but it's less now!

553
39:51.350 --> 39:56.772
Less? Is that all, or is it because you're seeing someone at the coffee shop?

554
39:56.772 --> 39:57.231
Huh?

555
39:57.231 --> 39:57.606
Huh?

556
40:01.380 --> 40:03.424
I’m not, I’m not.

557
40:03.487 --> 40:04.863
There’s no one.

558
40:04.863 --> 40:06.114
Hey!

559
40:06.657 --> 40:08.992
Ke, we're not here to get wasted.

560
40:09.326 --> 40:10.619
We still have class tomorrow.

561
40:11.954 --> 40:13.080
I'm going out first.

562
40:14.039 --> 40:15.040
- Okay? - Yeah, okay, okay.

563
40:15.040 --> 40:16.542
I’ll just get some fresh air, guys.

564
40:16.880 --> 40:20.312
I'm just gonna walk a bit. I ate so much.

565
40:20.337 --> 40:21.713
Text me, okay?

566
40:21.969 --> 40:24.066
- I'll just be outside. - I know.

567
40:24.091 --> 40:25.425
I won't go far.

568
40:25.425 --> 40:26.635
You take care, text me.

569
40:26.635 --> 40:28.095
Yeah, I'll just be outside.

570
40:28.262 --> 40:29.221
Cheers.

571
40:29.221 --> 40:31.014
Hey! Luna, how are you?

572
40:31.348 --> 40:32.724
I'm fine. You want to sit here first?

573
40:32.724 --> 40:33.767
Didn’t know you were here.

574
40:33.767 --> 40:35.102
Want some nachos?

575
40:48.597 --> 40:49.473
You’re drunk?

576
40:50.617 --> 40:51.910
You're here again.

577
40:52.536 --> 40:54.538
You're probably following me.

578
40:56.039 --> 40:58.000
I wonder why we keep running into each other.

579
40:58.166 --> 40:59.167
What do you think?

580
40:59.751 --> 41:00.627
Destiny?

581
41:02.337 --> 41:04.047
You believe in that?

582
41:04.848 --> 41:06.766
That doesn't fit your brand.

583
41:26.881 --> 41:27.943
Are you okay?

584
41:39.003 --> 41:40.797
Why are you suddenly crying?

585
41:42.552 --> 41:44.971
It's dirty there. Get up from there.

586
41:45.088 --> 41:47.966
It hurts. My head hurts.

587
41:52.304 --> 41:53.347
Here.

588
41:53.555 --> 41:54.723
Drink some.

589
41:58.769 --> 41:59.978
More.

590
42:04.191 --> 42:06.991
How do you know my name?

591
42:10.947 --> 42:12.240
From your I.D.

592
42:12.449 --> 42:12.824
What?

593
42:12.824 --> 42:14.326
It's attached to your bag.

594
42:14.868 --> 42:17.329
Kierra Zylene V. Ynares.

595
42:17.621 --> 42:20.540
So why did you follow me on IG?

596
42:22.125 --> 42:25.712
The real question is, why aren't you following me back?

597
42:25.837 --> 42:28.006
Why would I do that?

598
42:33.910 --> 42:35.226
Why are you laughing?

599
42:54.016 --> 42:55.585
You're too close.

600
43:01.206 --> 43:03.375
So, how close can we get, Kierra?

601
43:04.918 --> 43:06.586
What should be our limit?

602
43:07.379 --> 43:08.632
You tell me.

603
43:13.969 --> 43:15.483
Should there be a limit?

604
43:16.221 --> 43:17.436
Crazy idea.

605
43:19.291 --> 43:21.460
I want to get to know you more.

606
44:05.312 --> 44:06.563
I don't know.

607
44:07.105 --> 44:10.025
I just feel so unsatisfied these past few nights, bro.

608
44:11.234 --> 44:12.194
You?

609
44:12.652 --> 44:15.739
Unsatisfied with one-night stands?

610
44:17.621 --> 44:21.875
Maybe I'm getting too old for this kind of lifestyle.

611
44:22.329 --> 44:25.791
Or maybe you're starting to like someone?

612
44:27.042 --> 44:28.084
Maybe…

613
44:28.543 --> 44:32.005
Maybe your mind knows that you like that one girl.

614
44:32.380 --> 44:34.794
One girl. And maybe—

615
44:35.342 --> 44:39.427
your body starts rejecting sleeping around with some other girl.

616
44:40.388 --> 44:46.186
I think you want to settle down with one girl or commit yourself to one girl.

617
44:46.728 --> 44:47.771
Commit?

618
44:47.796 --> 44:50.872
You know I'm not the kind of guy who commits, right?

619
44:53.464 --> 44:54.173
See?

620
44:54.461 --> 44:56.546
Your body is already rejecting what you're saying.

621
44:56.720 --> 44:57.805
Come on.

622
44:59.241 --> 45:02.744
Okay, Shan. So it’s about the girl who gave you four thousand, right?

623
45:03.578 --> 45:05.247
You’ve been hanging out with her.

624
45:05.705 --> 45:06.581
Yeah.

625
45:06.957 --> 45:08.667
But she has nothing to do with this.

626
45:08.834 --> 45:10.460
Not everything is about her.

627
45:10.669 --> 45:12.170
Oh, come on, Shan,

628
45:12.170 --> 45:14.172
everything is all about her.

629
45:17.590 --> 45:20.529
Okay, fine. It's already 2AM here.

630
45:20.577 --> 45:21.786
I'll just call you again, okay?

631
45:22.055 --> 45:23.114
Okay.

632
45:23.471 --> 45:24.805
Just call me anytime.

633
45:25.475 --> 45:26.601
Bye.

634
45:27.435 --> 45:28.353
Take care.

635
45:40.991 --> 45:42.325
Name for the drinks?

636
45:43.076 --> 45:44.369
Kierra…

637
45:45.370 --> 45:46.913
and Theo.

638
46:20.113 --> 46:20.986
Nice feed.

639
46:22.414 --> 46:23.572
This is very her.

640
46:40.548 --> 46:42.064
What happened to your smile?

641
46:45.805 --> 46:47.474
Hello, Ma’am Kierra. Welcome back.

642
46:47.474 --> 46:50.908
Where’s the other barista, Shan? I just have something to ask.

643
46:50.933 --> 46:53.352
Oh, he's not here. He’s not on shift today.

644
46:53.664 --> 46:55.229
Ah, I see.

645
46:55.899 --> 46:58.985
You better be careful if you don't want your heart broken.

646
46:58.985 --> 46:59.861
Why?

647
47:00.403 --> 47:01.905
Is he really a red flag?

648
47:01.905 --> 47:04.824
All I know is he's a walking heartbreak

649
47:04.824 --> 47:07.452
but there's no chance of commitment with him.

650
47:07.452 --> 47:10.163
You know, Ke, don't think about us too much.

651
47:10.163 --> 47:11.873
We're fine, right?

652
47:11.873 --> 47:13.959
You wish I actually thought of you.

653
47:15.915 --> 47:17.417
How will you get home?

654
47:18.713 --> 47:20.830
Come on, I'll take you home.

655
47:20.855 --> 47:23.066
Is this how you invite your FWBs?

656
47:23.218 --> 47:27.597
For the record, this is the first time and you're the first girl

657
47:27.597 --> 47:29.307
I've invited to my unit.

658
47:29.408 --> 47:33.658
But okay, if you wanna come home to my place, I mean, I'm still down for that.

659
47:33.937 --> 47:35.146
It looks good on you.

660
47:35.897 --> 47:36.940
Do you have a crush on me?

661
47:37.732 --> 47:38.942
Is it that obvious?

662
47:38.942 --> 47:39.942
MkvDrama.net
